rkets price McCormick's chances around 94 percent.\n\nThe only public poll, a Democratic-sponsored August survey of likely voters, showed McCormick ahead by just three points, a notably tighter figure than the district's fundamentals suggest. That single survey carries limited weight on its own. McCormick's recent H-1B visa fraud advocacy and past controversy over anti-Muslim comments have drawn attention, but nothing indicates a serious threat to his hold on the seat.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0501, "margin": -12.18}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.1218, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0672, "margin": -10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0801, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.0796, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0786, "margin": -10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0751, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.0581, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0723, "margin": -11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0639, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.0756, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.1071, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.1041, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0789, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.027, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0454, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.0486, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.026, "margin": -13.0}]}